== Used by the package (a package reference) ==

HarfBuzzSharp (the .NET binding) and the HarfBuzz text shaping engine it wraps
  Licence: MIT (HarfBuzzSharp); "Old MIT" (HarfBuzz)
  https://github.com/mono/SkiaSharp (HarfBuzzSharp) and https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz
  The only native code Pdfwright depends on. Shaping only: Pdfwright does not use SkiaSharp or Skia.

HarfBuzzSharp.NativeAssets.Linux (and, through HarfBuzzSharp, the Windows and macOS native assets)
  Licence: MIT
  The HarfBuzz native library for Linux, glibc and musl, every architecture.

== Used only by the tests ==

PdfPig
  Licence: Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/UglyToad/PdfPig
  Reads a generated PDF back so that text order is tested. Not part of the package.

xunit.v3
  Licence: Apache-2.0

qpdf (a command-line tool run by the tests and CI, never linked)
  Licence: Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/qpdf/qpdf
  Checks the structure of every generated PDF.

== Used only by the benchmarks ==

BenchmarkDotNet
  Licence: MIT

Playwright (the baseline script only: benchmarks/Pdfwright.Benchmarks/Baselines)
  Licence: Apache-2.0
  Measured for comparison, never a dependency.

== Carried in the repository (the test corpus; the package ships none of it) ==

Noto Sans (Regular, Bold, Italic), Noto Sans Arabic, Noto Sans Hebrew, Noto Sans Devanagari,
Noto Sans Bengali, Noto Sans Tamil, Noto Sans Thai
  Licence: SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
  Copyright: The Noto Project Authors (the repository of each script is named in the copyright line of the
  font and of its licence text)
  Source, hash and copyright line of every font: tests/Pdfwright.Tests/Fonts/manifest.json
  Licence texts: tests/Pdfwright.Tests/Fonts/OFL-*.txt
  The fonts are unmodified and not renamed.

== Data compiled into the package ==

The Unicode Character Database, version 18.0.0 (Unicode License v3, Copyright (c) 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.)
  Used: the bidirectional class, paired brackets, line break class, grapheme cluster break class, East Asian Width,
  Extended_Pictographic, Indic_Conjunct_Break, scripts and script extensions and a few General_Category facts, turned into tables by
  tools/Pdfwright.UnicodeGen and compiled into the library (src/Pdfwright/Unicode/*.g.cs).
  The conformance files (BidiTest, BidiCharacterTest, LineBreakTest, GraphemeBreakTest) are used by the tests only and are not in the package.
  The licence text, copied from the Unicode data files, follows.

